                        <h2 class="title">砥砺奋进又五年 | 共青团绍兴市第一中学第十三次代表大会召开</h2>
                        <!-- 副标题 -->
                        <h3 class="subTitle"><span></span></h3>
                        <script>
                        $(".Subheading span:empty").parent().hide()
                        </script>
                        <div class="property"> <span>文章来源：</span> <span>作者：</span> <span>发布时间：2021年06月02日</span> <span>点击数：
    <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/Common/GetHits.aspx?id=13565"></script>
    次</span>  <span><span id="content_AdminEdit"></span>
<script type="text/javascript">
$(document).ready(function()
{
    $.pe.ajax('admineditcheck',{params:{itemId:13565},success:function(s) {
        if ($(s).find('status').text() == 'OK') {
            var managedir = "/Common/GetContentEdit.aspx?itemId=13565";
           $("#content_AdminEdit").html("【<a href='" + managedir + "' target='_blank'>进入后台编辑</a>】")
        }
    }});
});
</script></span> </div>
                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="text-indent: 32px; line-height: 150%; text-align: center;"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,0);background:rgb(255,255,0)"><span style="font-family:宋体"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/6/202106020804304913.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202106020804304913.jpg" /></span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">2021年5月31日，共青团绍兴市第一中学第十三次代表大会在学校树兰楼会议室四召开。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;"> </span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 150%"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">大会前</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 150%"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"></span></strong></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/6/202106020805186007.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202106020805186007.jpg" /></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/6/202106020805188882.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202106020805188882.jpg" /></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/6/202106020805181294.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202106020805181294.jpg" /></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">学校党委书记、校长王琛同志，党委副书记、纪委书记孙洪亮同志，副校长、工会主席蒋明同志，副校长俞奇弘同志出席本次大会。全校</span>130名团员代表参加大会。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 150%"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">第一部分</span>·大会预备会议</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 32px; line-height: 150%; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/6/202106020806088281.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202106020806088281.jpg" /></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 32px; line-height: 150%; text-align: center;"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">审议通过代表资格审查报告、大会主席团</span>/秘书长名单及议程。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 150%"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">第二部分</span>·大会开幕式</span></strong></p><p style="line-height: 150%; text-indent: 0em; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/6/202106020806528292.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202106020806528292.JPG" /></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;">>在庄严的国歌声中，大会正式开幕。开幕式由党委副书记孙洪亮同志主持。</span></p><p style="line-height: 150%; text-align: center; text-indent: 0em;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/6/202106020807369027.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202106020807369027.jpg" /><span style="font-family: 宋体;">>党委书记王琛同志致开幕词。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">他向大会召开表示祝贺，并对到场的青年师生代表致以问候。他勉励全体青年师生坚定信念、志存高远，增长才干、开拓进取，遵章守纪、作好表率，不断开创学校共青团事业发展的新局面，以优异的学习和工作成绩向党和国家、学校和家人交出一份满意的答卷。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px; line-height: 150%; text-align: center;"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,0);background:rgb(255,255,0)"><span style="font-family:宋体"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/6/202106020808350747.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202106020808350747.JPG" /></span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px; line-height: 150%; text-align: center;"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">>工会主席蒋明同志致贺词。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">他肯定了学校团委近五年来的工作成绩，表示学校工会与共青要团共同学习、相互支持、团结奋斗，共同在党的领导下，充分发挥群团组织的各自优势，为学校发展和师生成长进一步贡献才智和力量。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px; line-height: 150%; text-align: center;"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,0);background:rgb(255,255,0)"><span style="font-family:宋体"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/6/202106020809068686.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202106020809068686.JPG" /></span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">>团委书记金笛同志代表第十二届团委作工作报告。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">报告总结了过去的成绩与不足，并阐明未来五年的发展方向。报告指出，学校团委将坚守红色初心，坚定育人使命，坚持改革创新，用实际行动和一流业绩迎接党的锤炼与挑选。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 150%"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">第三部分</span>·大会正式会议</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 32px; line-height: 150%; text-align: center;"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">>审议通过大会选举办法、新一届委员候选人名单、监/计票人名单。</span></p><p style="text-align: center;">
</p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 150%"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">无记名投票</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,0);background:rgb(255,255,0)"><span style="font-family:宋体"></span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/6/202106020813094019.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202106020813094019.jpg" /></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/6/202106020813093092.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202106020813093092.JPG" /></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">本次大会贯彻民主集中制，代表们充分行使民主权利。最终差额选举产生共青团绍兴市第一中学第十三届委员会委员</span>9名。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">在新一届委员会会议中选举产生共青团绍兴市第一中学第十三届委员会书记、副书记各</span>1名。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px; line-height: 150%; text-align: center;"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,0);background:rgb(255,255,0)"><span style="font-family:宋体"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/6/202106020813309652.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202106020813309652.jpg" /></span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">>在激昂的团歌声中，本次大会顺利闭幕。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,0);background:rgb(255,255,0)"><span style="font-family:宋体"></span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/6/202106020813544893.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202106020813544893.png" /></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/6/202106020813545499.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202106020813545499.png" /></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">新一届团委将围绕我校</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">“存古开新，兼容并包”的办学理念，秉持“求真”校训、“博雅”校风，大力发扬“孺子牛”“拓荒牛”“老黄牛”精神，不断向前，落实立德树人根本任务，以培养担当民族复兴大任的时代新人为着眼点，继续引导青年师生成长成才。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;"> </span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 150%"><span style=";font-family:楷体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">供稿：校团委</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 150%"><span style=";font-family:楷体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:楷体">摄影：摄影社（陈非鱼</span><span style="font-family:楷体">裘捷</span><span style="font-family:楷体">林伊涵</span><span style="font-family:楷体">郭宇乐</span><span style="font-family:楷体">单晨怿）</span></span></p><p>
</p>
    
